What are Interceptors?
- Interceptor ek aisa component hota hai jo request aur response ke beech me aakar kuch extra processing karta hai — bina main business logic ko disturb kiye.
- even before controller get called. not like, Spring-Aop because Aop comes after controller.
Simple words me:
          Client → Interceptor → Controller → Interceptor → Client

🔹 In Spring Boot (MVC) Context
              - Spring Boot me Interceptor ka use HTTP request ko handle karne se pehle ya baad me kuch kaam karne ke liye hota hai.
              - Ye HandlerInterceptor interface implement karta hai.

🔹 Interceptor Flow Diagram :

                                 Client Request
                                        .
                                        .
                                        v
                                 +----------------------+
                                 |  Dispatcher Servlet  |
                                 +----------------------+
                                        .
                                        .
                                        v
                                 +----------------------+
                                 |     Interceptor      |
                                 +----------------------+
                                        .
                                        .
                                        v
                                   ..............................
                                   .              .             .
                                   v              v             v
                                +------------+ +------------+ +------------+
                                | Controller1| | Controller2| | Controller3|
                                +------------+ +------------+ +------------+
                                                 .
                                                 .
                                                 v
                                        (Response back same path)

🔹 Real Use Cases :
   ✅ Logging (request log karna)
   ✅ Authentication check
   ✅ Authorization
   ✅ Request time calculate karna
   ✅ Global header add karna

🔹 What is HandlerInterceptor in Spring Boot?
  - HandlerInterceptor Spring MVC ka ek interface hai jo request ko Controller tak pahunchne se pehle aur Controller ke baad intercept (rok kar process) karne ke liye use hota hai.
  - Ye mostly logging, authentication, authorization, timing, etc. ke liye use hota hai.
  - Spring me ye interface available hota hai:
                                👉 org.springframework.web.servlet.HandlerInterceptor
🔹 HandlerInterceptor ke 3 Important Methods :
1️⃣ preHandle() :
           - Controller execute hone se pehle chalta hai
           - Agar true return kare → request controller tak jayegi
           - Agar false return kare → request wahi ruk jayegi
👉 Mostly authentication ke liye use hota hai.
2️⃣ postHandle() :
           - Controller method execute hone ke baad
           - Response client ko bhejne se pehle
👉 Mostly response modify karne ya logging ke liye
3️⃣ afterCompletion() :
           - Request completely complete hone ke baad
           - Exception aayi ho tab bhi chalega
👉 Cleanup work ke liye.

✅ WebMvcConfigurer kya hota hai?
WebMvcConfigurer Spring MVC ka ek interface hai jo aapko default MVC configuration ko customize karne ka option deta hai,
jisme default methods hote hain jinko override karke aap Spring MVC ka behavior customize kar sakte ho.
Yeh normally use hota hai:
      - CORS configuration ke liye
      - Custom Interceptor add karne ke liye
      - Resource handler configure karne ke liye
      - Message converters customize karne ke liye
      - View resolvers configure karne ke liye
👉 in it , there is a method called, public void addInterceptors(InterceptorRegistry registry) , it help us to register
our interceptor into Spring MVC DispatcherServlet ke request processing chain me.

🔹 Interceptor vs Filter (Important Difference) :
| Feature  | Interceptor          | Filter                     |
| -------- | -------------------- | -------------------------- |
| Part of  | Spring MVC           | Servlet API                |
| Works on | Handler level        | Servlet level              |
| Use case | Business-level logic | Generic request processing |
| Example  | Auth check           | CORS, Encoding             |
👉 Filter servlet container level pe kaam karta hai
👉 Interceptor Spring MVC level pe kaam karta hai
